Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:07.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你都占為己有又付之一炬
